  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nFor 4 seconds after you take
    damage, the team attacks 10% faster.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nRun / Pickup radius:
    +0.08\nRun / Luck: -0.01\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces
    support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA collector of letters with
    missing addresses, they once mistook silence for permission to read them. Delivering
    an apology unopened began their first honest route. They want a postal service
    that also lets a recipient refuse a letter.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nEvery 4s in
    combat, gain 1 gold directly. This is not kill loot and does not count as collecting
    a coin.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed memories; their stated percentages
    are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly stated. Listed support modifiers
    scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: archive, gauntlet, ball. Immortal. Weapon
    rolls on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star bodies merge unless the
    talent forbids it."
